=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Bring vegetables to a boil, reduce heat and simmer until fork-tender.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Drain vegetables.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Heat milk and butter until butter is melted.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Mash vegetables together; stir in milk mixture.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Season with salt and pepper. Let cool completely.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Refrigerate up to 5 days.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Preheat over to 375. Spoon beef stew into baking dish(es). Cover with vegetable mash; sprinkle cheese on top.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Bake 50 minutes.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Let cool 15 minutes before serving.</li> </ol> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"endeasyrecipe\" title=\"style002\" style=\"display: none\">3.5.3226</div> </div><br />\n </p>\n"
